# Build artifacts
/target
# Example WASM plugins build in their own (detached) workspaces
plugins-src/*/target/
plugins-src/*/Cargo.lock

# Local runtime data: SQLite DB, scraped artifacts, browser profile (login cookies)
/data

# Claude Code session logs and local settings — but the shared session
# contract (CLAUDE.md) and the doc-sync Stop hook (settings.json) are
# versioned so every checkout gets the same enforcement.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
# Skills are shared method, not local state — they travel with the repo so a
# fresh checkout (or another machine) gets the same workflows.
!.claude/skills/

# Registry lane-skill OVERLAYS. The skill bodies are symlinks into ai-registry's
# skills/ lane (machine state, ignored in the managed block at the bottom of this
# file); everything pumper-specific lives in these overlays and IS versioned, so a
# fresh checkout gets the same gates, taste and repo law.
!.claude/architect/
!.claude/explorer/
!.claude/perfect/
!.claude/research/
# ship-loop keeps its mutable loop state in the same directory — track only the
# hand-maintained overlay, never state.md / backlog.md / journal.md / decisions.md.
!.claude/ship-loop/
.claude/ship-loop/*
!.claude/ship-loop/config.md
!.claude/ship-loop/references/

# Secrets / local environment overrides
.env
*.local

# Personal cost ledger — read locally by the Personas passport, never shared.
app-cost.json

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# BEGIN ai-registry linked skills (managed by ai-registry/scripts/link-registry.mjs)
# Links are machine state; the declarations live in .ai/manifest.yaml (`skills:` and `knowledge.domains`).
/.claude/skills/architect
/.claude/skills/conform
/.claude/skills/consult
/.claude/skills/explorer
/.claude/skills/perfect
/.claude/skills/research
/.claude/skills/scan-sweep
/.claude/skills/ship-loop
/.claude/skills/test-before-commit
/.claude/skills/tiger
/.claude/rules/ai-registry-access.md
/.claude/rules/ai-registry-software-engineering.md
/.claude/rules/ai-registry-llm-observability.md
# END ai-registry linked skills
